json5/structured
description: Composite value that nests other JSON5 values
- >
  The structured shapes of JSON5 are those of JSON - the keyed **object** and the positional
  **list** - each extended with small sugars:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  {matrix: [[1, 0], [0, 1],], meta: {unit: true},}
- >
  See the subchapters below for the two shapes:
- *: 00-json5_object
- *: 01-json5_list
